        "id": "2121394949182930954",
        "images": [],
        "media": [],
        "name": "Lingxi Li",
        "text": "we optimized it heavily so it should burn only a little of your usage.\n\ngo invite your e-coworker to the meeting, and let us know what you think!!",
        "url": "https://x.com/lingxi/status/2121394949182930954",
        "verified": true,
        "verified_type": "individual"
      },
      "retweet": {
