      "type": "引用",
      "type_label": "引用",
      "text": "The epic day has arrived, thanks to the incredibly talented team at SpaceX!",
      "quote": {
        "author": "WalterIsaacson",
        "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1208967434503409665/3c7F4X92_200x200.jpg",
        "created_at_shanghai": "2026-11-15 06:00:52",
        "created_at_utc": "2026-11-14T22:00:52.000Z",
        "id": "2121725076919717899",
        "images": [],
        "media": [],
        "name": "Walter Isaacson",
        "text": "This is actually a bigger deal for humanity than most people can imagine. I will always remember the looks on the engineers’ faces  in the Starbase conference room in December 2020 when @elonmusk suggested, then insisted, that the Mechazilla launchpad arms could catch a returning Starship.",
        "url": "https://x.com/WalterIsaacson/status/2121725076919717899",
        "verified": true,
        "verified_type": "individual"
      },
